WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.106
Mom: Good morning!

2
00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:09.318
Dad: What do you want?

3
00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:11.285
Milk or juice?

4
00:00:11.286 --> 00:00:16.813
Peter: I want milk, please.

5
00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:19.631
Mom: Pancakes or cereal, Peter?

6
00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:26.154
Peter: I want pancakes, please.

7
00:00:26.155 --> 00:00:29.464
Yummy! I love pancakes! Lisa:

8
00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:32.639
Mommy! I want pancakes too!

9
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:38.245
Mom: Eat your cereal, Lisa.

